  "notes": "Kinto Gmail Notification Workflow (v3 - Task Events)\n\n**VERSION 3 UPDATES:**\nThis workflow handles the three new task management events:\n- task.created: Send email to assigned user\n- task.assigned: Send email to newly assigned user\n- task.updated (status: completed): Send email to all team members\n\n**KEY FEATURES:**\n- Plain text emails (not HTML) for accessibility\n- Compliance footer on all emails\n- Role-based recipient filtering\n- Separate branches for each event type\n- Uses API key authentication (Bearer token)\n\n**EVENT ROUTING:**\n1. Webhook Trigger receives event from Kinto EventBus\n2. Extract Payload parses event fields (eventType, taskId, taskTitle, etc.)\n3. Event Router branches to specific event handlers:\n   - task.created → Get assigned user → Send notification\n   - task.assigned → Get assigned user → Send notification\n   - task.updated (completed) → Get all users → Send broadcast\n\n**WEBHOOK PAYLOAD FORMAT (v3):**\n{\n  \"hub_id\": \"uuid\",\n  \"event_type\": \"task.created|task.assigned|task.updated\",\n  \"task_id\": \"uuid\",\n  \"task_title\": \"string\",\n  \"assigned_to\": \"number (user ID) | null\",\n  \"priority\": \"low|medium|high\",\n  \"old_status\": \"pending|in_progress|completed\" (only for task.updated),\n  \"new_status\": \"pending|in_progress|completed\" (only for task.updated),\n  \"timestamp\": \"ISO 8601 datetime\"\n}\n\n**SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:**\n1. Generate API key: node scripts/generate-n8n-api-key.mjs <HUB_ID> 1\n2. Set n8n environment variables:\n   - KINTO_API_KEY: Your generated API key\n   - KINTO_API_HOST: Your Kinto host (e.g., kinto.example.com)\n   - KINTO_SENDER_EMAIL: Sender email address\n3. Replace 'YOUR_LLC_GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID' with your actual Gmail credential ID\n4. Import this workflow into n8n cloud\n5. Test with sample task events\n6. Activate the workflow\n\n**ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES REQUIRED:**\n- KINTO_API_KEY: API key for authentication (Bearer token)\n- KINTO_API_HOST: Kinto API host URL\n- KINTO_SENDER_EMAIL: Email address to send from\n\n**ENDPOINT DETAILS:**\nURL: https://{{ $env.KINTO_API_HOST }}/api/trpc/users.getByRoleWithApiKey\nMethod: POST\nAuth: Bearer {{ $env.KINTO_API_KEY }}\nPermissions: users:read\n\n**EMAIL TEMPLATES:**\nAll emails use plain text format with compliance footer:\n\"Kinto Care is a logistics and data coordination tool. No medical diagnosis provided.\"\n\n**DOCUMENTATION:**\nSee TASK_WEBHOOK_PAYLOADS.md for complete payload documentation.\nSee API_KEY_N8N_SETUP.md for API key setup guide.\n\n**MIGRATION FROM V2:**\nV2 handled generic broadcast events (task.created, task.claimed, task.completed).\nV3 handles specific task management events with proper routing:\n- task.created: New task notification\n- task.assigned: Task assignment notification\n- task.updated: Status change notification (completed only)\n\nReplace the v2 workflow with this v3 workflow in n8n."
